无使用此ID。wow、贴吧、CHH、S1、其他微博等各种同名马甲以及打本人名号发帖者，均不是我本人。[/b][/color]","nickname":"","bit_data":135594663,"remark":{"23573":{"0":23573,"1":35159831,"2":1621358038,"3":1,"4":"杂谈区域仲裁"}}},"331310":{"uid":331310,"username":"孤而不单","credit":136061478,"medal":"44,37,13,84,56,65,27,29,45,83,101","reputation":"6_433,16_15,17_1,13_150,61_1,228_10","groupid":66,"memberid":66,"avatar":"","yz":4,"site":"故纸堆","honor":"","regdate":1142969790,"mute_time":"","postnum":4375,"rvrc":331,"money":326430,"thisvisit":1786082998,"signature":"不会说宁波话的宁波佬。<br/>我叫发哥，牧师区前版主，一个天真可爱负责任的男孩子，春夏喜欢打NBA，秋冬交公粮蒙面糙人，BOSS战只有80%几率拿硬币卡1键刷快疗休息下，上单30分钟不挪窝打野3分半送红蓝，但我知道什么是负责任的队友，我发誓今年afk一定不超过11个月。对了，IBM的产品最棒最灵活了，你一定要用哦。","nickname":"","bit_data":136061478},"15169320":{"uid":15169320,"username":"蒜灬头","credit":169087654,"medal":"4,443,350","reputation":"56_30,19_1005,58_25,22_7485,48_60,103_600,83_120,39_60,134_75,130_240,198_2,128_190,197_10,209_10,47_30,192_20,142_60,199_30,91_20,46_20,218_150,196_70,208_50,228_135,122_40,237_40,61_145,71_30,428_15,265_30,262_10,143_30,261_10","groupid":83,"memberid":83,"avatar":"https://img.nga.cn/avatars/2002/728/e77/000/15169320_2.jpg?86|.a/15169320_3.jpg?26","yz":4,"site":"","honor":" 1617853376 $notitle$","regdate":1327369684,"mute_time":"","postnum":34654,"rvrc":607,"money":1013677,"thisvisit":1786188514,"signature":"[l][img]https://img.nga.178.com/attachments/mon_201910/21/-914q0Q5-ci47ZbT1kS5t-87.png[/img][/l][r][img]https://img.nga.178.com/attachments/mon_201910/21/-914q0Q5-l0laZfT1kS6g-87.png[/img][/r]<br/>[align=center][quote]<br/>[b][color=red]You just focus on doing what you can and leave the rest up to God[/color][/b]<br/>[color=blue][b]喜欢英雄联盟、绝地求生、王者荣耀、堡垒之夜等国内外职业/高玩视频的小伙伴，欢迎[/b][/color][url=https://space.bilibili.com/10045699][color=deeppink][b]点我订阅[/b][/color][/url]<br/>[url=http://weibo.com/nga178com][img]http://service.t.sina.com.cn/widget/qmd/3973248709/2a643e7f/5.png[/img][/url]<br/>[/quote][/align]","nickname":"","bit_data":169087654},"__GROUPS":{"3":{"0":"Titan","